            <div xml:id="d121">

                <pb facs="0195" n="183" sameAs="frus:frus1940v01/pg183"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">857.0011/93: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kennedy</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-08-31">August 31,
                        1940</date>.<lb/>[Received August 31—9:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>From Schoenfeld, Norwegian series No. 2, 31st. The King of Norway summoned me
                    this morning and requested that following message be conveyed to the President:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“I am deeply grateful to you for all you are doing for the Crown
                            Princess. Both I and the Crown Prince assure you of our deep thanks and
                            our very warm regards.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed> [Schoenfeld] <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kennedy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
